{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03447","headline":"拟古神女宛转歌二首 二 · 崔液","name":"拟古神女宛转歌二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日已暮，长檐鸟应度。\n此时望君君不来，此时思君君不顾。\n歌宛转，宛转那能异栖宿。\n愿爲形与影，出入恒相逐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔液","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03447.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03447","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}